WEBVTT

1
00:00:04.020 --> 00:00:11.940
34. Are you addicted to the Internet? Internet addiction is a relatively new and

2
00:00:11.940 --> 00:00:17.900
controversial disorder. Though it is still not recognized as a specific disorder by all

3
00:00:17.900 --> 00:00:23.980
doctors, many people see the signs of Internet overuse in their lives and are trying to fight

4
00:00:23.980 --> 00:00:31.740
it. Most compulsive Internet users are hooked on a few specific activities—online buying

5
00:00:31.740 --> 00:00:38.380
or gambling, online relationships, including social networking, computer games, and compulsive

6
00:00:38.380 --> 00:00:45.820
data searching. These are activities that many of us often perform. Some people, however,

7
00:00:45.820 --> 00:00:51.860
find them hard to stop. Their online activities may become more important than their real-life

8
00:00:51.860 --> 00:00:58.380
activities. They may allow relationships to die because they only spend time with Internet

9
00:00:58.380 --> 00:01:04.500
friends. They may be unable to stop playing computer games and ignore chores or family

10
00:01:04.500 --> 00:01:11.140
time. People often turn to the Internet for stress relief or to get away from their problems

11
00:01:11.140 --> 00:01:17.660
for a few minutes. However, some people may become too dependent on escaping into the Internet.

12
00:01:17.660 --> 00:01:24.420
The Internet becomes a destructive force in their lives. To check for possible Internet

13
00:01:24.420 --> 00:01:30.820
addiction or compulsion, doctors will ask you a few key questions. They ask about whether

14
00:01:30.820 --> 00:01:37.220
spending time online is affecting your school or work performance. They ask if family or

15
00:01:37.220 --> 00:01:43.460
friends complain about your Internet use and if you form more new relationships online

16
00:01:43.460 --> 00:01:49.220
than offline. They ask if you worry that life without the Internet would be useless and

17
00:01:49.220 --> 00:01:56.620
boring, if you often stay online longer than you intended, or if you lie about how long you've been

18
00:01:56.620 --> 00:02:03.100
in front of the computer. We use the Internet so much that when it becomes an unhealthy addiction,

19
00:02:03.100 --> 00:02:11.140
it can be hard to spot. Think carefully about how you use the Internet. Even useful tools can be

20
00:02:11.140 --> 00:02:12.140
dangerous.
